WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.760
Was it the beginning?

00:10.260 --> 00:12.810
Was it the end?

00:17.150 --> 00:18.690
When I met them...

00:18.770 --> 00:20.360
When I was with them...

00:20.820 --> 00:22.940
something within me ended...

00:23.150 --> 00:24.320
something within me changed.

00:27.780 --> 00:29.030
That..

00:29.290 --> 00:31.620
That is why I must go...

00:32.250 --> 00:34.540
to Kitabayashi, where Mataichi-san and his group are,

00:35.380 --> 00:36.920
even if what awaits me there...

00:39.000 --> 00:41.550
is terror beyond imagination.

00:48.200 --> 00:56.970
(Wanting you to just be near,
to feel your breath upon my ear)

00:57.010 --> 01:06.010
(Wishing you would call my name,
'Cause only you can light the flame)

01:06.050 --> 01:12.780
Constantly searching,
still can't find

01:15.390 --> 01:21.460
Ever illusive peace of mind

01:23.630 --> 01:32.200
Sometimes it's near,
but slips away

01:32.240 --> 01:38.840
And I'm faced with another day

01:40.050 --> 01:45.780
Of wanting you...
(to feel your breath upon my ear)

01:45.820 --> 01:50.120
...to just be near
('Cause only you can light the flame)

01:50.160 --> 01:54.600
Of wishing you...
(to feel your breath upon my ear)

01:54.630 --> 01:59.030
...would call my name,
to feel your breath upon my ear

01:59.070 --> 02:03.560
Of wanting you... wishing you...
(to feel your breath upon my ear)

02:03.610 --> 02:11.450
Call my name, 'cause only
you can light the flame

02:19.180 --> 02:19.210
Shinigami, or rather, the Shichinin Misaki: Part II

02:48.750 --> 02:51.210
I am Lady Misaki.

02:51.630 --> 02:54.210
I am unable to carry out the vengeance I seek.

02:54.590 --> 02:58.300
If you wish to quell my curse, enshrine me!

02:58.300 --> 03:01.390
Enshrine... me!

03:17.310 --> 03:19.020
The curse of Lady Misaki?

03:19.030 --> 03:21.230
Yes, my lord. It appears that even
the inner court's female attendants,

03:21.240 --> 03:24.740
including the head female
attendants, are in a panic over it.

03:24.780 --> 03:28.280
They say that she may be
the spirit of Kaedo no Kata-sama.

03:29.040 --> 03:32.750
Are you suggesting that my mother would curse us?

03:37.420 --> 03:40.760
There are already people who are
spreading that rumor throughout the city.

03:41.340 --> 03:42.680
What should we do?

03:42.890 --> 03:44.300
Kill them.

03:45.390 --> 03:48.560
I don't care whether they are the female
attendants or the head female attendants.

03:50.100 --> 03:51.810
I don't care who they are at all.

03:58.650 --> 04:00.150
Listen, everyone!

04:00.490 --> 04:02.570
The lord of the castle, Danjou-sama,

04:02.570 --> 04:05.830
has decreed that anyone who spreads
these outrageous rumors of Lady Misaki's revival

04:05.830 --> 04:07.410
must be eliminated immediately,

04:07.410 --> 04:10.080
regardless of their social status!

04:10.330 --> 04:11.460
Master Clerk!

04:11.710 --> 04:12.750
Show mercy!

04:13.670 --> 04:16.090
These people are to be burned at the stake now.

04:16.090 --> 04:17.340
Now then...

04:18.090 --> 04:22.510
You... Before that, wouldn't you like to taste them?

04:23.560 --> 04:27.600
You can lay your hands on the lord's female attendants,

04:27.640 --> 04:29.650
who all have his stamp of approval!

04:51.750 --> 04:53.760
Our tutelary shrine!

04:53.800 --> 04:55.010
It's a curse!

04:55.300 --> 04:58.050
It <i>is</i> the curse of Lady Misaki!

04:58.350 --> 05:00.810
Damn you. Do you still persist in this nonsense?

04:58.350 --> 04:59.350
It's a curse!

04:59.350 --> 05:00.810
A curse!

05:06.860 --> 05:08.230
There is no curse!

05:08.570 --> 05:10.980
Those are the words of our lord, Danjou-sama!

05:12.740 --> 05:13.780
What's going on?

05:14.150 --> 05:16.160
That's the family temple of the castle!

05:16.240 --> 05:17.780
As we've thought, this really must be...

05:23.000 --> 05:24.170
a curse...

05:24.420 --> 05:25.750
Indeed, this province is...

05:25.750 --> 05:27.090
under the curse of Lady Misaki...

05:31.300 --> 05:32.800
Can you not hear it?

05:32.800 --> 05:34.800
The wrathful cry of Lady Misaki.

05:35.430 --> 05:36.970
Can you not hear it?

05:37.180 --> 05:39.180
That voice that lingers here and curses us all.

05:40.350 --> 05:42.270
If you can hear it, then pray.

05:42.440 --> 05:45.060
Pray that she cools her wrath.

05:45.820 --> 05:49.780
Lady Misaki resides there!

05:52.780 --> 05:54.070
Pray.

05:55.740 --> 05:58.040
Those who do not pray will die.

05:58.080 --> 06:01.120
But just praying will not save you.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.420
Then what do we need to do?

06:02.420 --> 06:04.380
Please tell us, honorable monk!

06:04.920 --> 06:10.430
[Note: Darani is a Buddhist chant that hasn't been translated from Sanskrit.]

06:04.920 --> 06:10.430
Then you should pray to these
very holy fuda with the Darani.

06:12.260 --> 06:14.430
[Note: Mon is an obsolete monetary unit.]

06:12.260 --> 06:14.430
One fuda costs a mere fifteen mon!

06:14.560 --> 06:16.640
Use these fuda while you are still alive!

06:19.100 --> 06:22.770
Here, take these fuda to the people in the castle.

06:22.770 --> 06:24.150
Thank you.

06:29.200 --> 06:33.990
"You've gotten him involved this far, and now this?"

06:34.750 --> 06:36.870
Sensei is always like that.

06:37.580 --> 06:39.960
I guess it was the pot calling the kettle black.

06:44.210 --> 06:48.140
Ohh... I can see it went well.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.390
Where's sensei?

06:50.600 --> 06:53.270
Now that you mention it, he slipped out some time ago.

06:53.270 --> 06:54.180
He couldn't have...

07:11.660 --> 07:12.830
Ukon-san...

07:13.580 --> 07:16.920
That samurai was searching for a place to die.

07:17.340 --> 07:19.550
I won't let him be in a place where he will die!

07:47.830 --> 07:48.950
So we meet again.

07:49.790 --> 07:53.670
You're Shiragiku... no, Tatsuta-san!

07:53.880 --> 07:55.710
You remember me?

07:59.010 --> 08:00.510
We won't let you get away.

08:00.550 --> 08:02.140
Sis, who's this?

08:02.300 --> 08:05.510
A friend of the rats who are playing tricks in the town.

08:05.680 --> 08:09.560
After barely making it out alive,
you came leaping in again...

08:10.600 --> 08:13.230
into this Danjou-sama's drawing of hell.

08:13.440 --> 08:16.150
As I thought, you were reenacting the Muzan'e!

08:18.530 --> 08:19.570
Reenacting?

08:21.700 --> 08:24.370
Danjou-sama has no interest in that.

08:24.790 --> 08:27.160
Take a look at those demons.

08:27.790 --> 08:32.460
That's the first group that was brought here.

08:32.920 --> 08:36.720
They were the most virtuous
people in the province; good filial sons.

08:37.340 --> 08:38.840
And now look at them.

08:38.890 --> 08:40.640
In their desperation to live,

08:40.640 --> 08:43.470
they torment, rape, and kill.

08:44.270 --> 08:47.640
Now they enjoy it more than anything.

08:49.980 --> 08:51.230
You're...

08:51.610 --> 08:54.070
Danjou-sama wished to test it.

08:54.400 --> 08:56.490
How far can people fall?

08:56.530 --> 09:00.030
And after they've fallen and fallen, what do they become?

09:00.450 --> 09:02.790
I doubt you'd understand now...

09:03.330 --> 09:05.330
but sooner or later...

09:06.250 --> 09:07.830
Stop it!

09:07.840 --> 09:11.090
You'll understand, too! You'll understand, too!

09:15.430 --> 09:16.640
Momosuke-dono!

09:18.640 --> 09:19.930
Ukon-san!

09:20.180 --> 09:21.770
You're safe!

09:21.850 --> 09:22.600
Yes.

09:23.100 --> 09:24.850
I was able to see my wife.

09:25.060 --> 09:27.060
Then... she's...

09:27.230 --> 09:30.480
Since she hadn't come to term like the
woman in the painting, she stayed alive.

09:30.900 --> 09:32.280
But her spirit...

09:32.740 --> 09:34.570
She lost her spirit...

09:36.280 --> 09:37.370
Even so...

09:37.370 --> 09:41.500
I was able to meet her thanks to you, Momosuke-dono.

09:41.540 --> 09:42.580
I thank you.

09:42.580 --> 09:43.960
That's...

09:44.750 --> 09:48.460
More importantly, Momosuke-dono... look at that.

09:55.720 --> 09:57.470
That can't be...!

09:57.470 --> 10:00.100
Yes, it is the Hikasou.

10:01.850 --> 10:03.860
We need to stop it!

10:04.190 --> 10:06.780
Then will you give me a hand?

10:09.320 --> 10:10.700
Ogin-san!

10:10.740 --> 10:13.620
Jeez... you're such a pain.

10:38.690 --> 10:42.110
Listen... don't take any actions until our setup is complete.

10:42.530 --> 10:43.860
Just sit tight.

10:44.280 --> 10:45.400
Until when?

10:45.530 --> 10:46.490
Soon enough,

10:46.780 --> 10:50.700
so don't think about trying to save your wife alone.

10:51.410 --> 10:55.290
Ogin-san, I was just scared.

10:55.290 --> 10:55.620
What?

10:56.170 --> 11:00.130
When I saw those pictures...
I came upon the same idea as them...

11:00.670 --> 11:02.760
Am I the same as them?

11:03.300 --> 11:07.050
I wanted to know that... with my own eyes.

11:12.390 --> 11:15.980
You've been hanging around us too much, sensei.

11:16.360 --> 11:18.900
You've just seen one or two too many ugly things.

11:20.230 --> 11:21.360
Be at peace.

11:22.280 --> 11:25.950
No matter what happens, you're a human being, sensei.

11:29.410 --> 11:30.540
Th-This is...

11:32.210 --> 11:33.870
They're dead! All of them!

11:34.040 --> 11:35.960
Just like the monk said!

11:38.090 --> 11:39.210
Pray!

11:40.920 --> 11:43.050
The day of the curse is near.

11:45.260 --> 11:49.350
The terrible rage of Lady Misaki will strike this place.

11:49.850 --> 11:51.850
Honorable monk, please...

11:51.850 --> 11:55.400
When is the day of the curse, of the catastrophe?

11:55.520 --> 11:57.610
It will rain on that day.

11:57.940 --> 11:58.440
Rain?

11:58.570 --> 11:59.400
It will rain?

11:59.490 --> 12:03.740
Indeed. A rainy night when the
balance of Yin and Yang is disturbed.

12:03.740 --> 12:05.620
It will be the hour of demons.

12:06.290 --> 12:11.790
To avert this catastrophe,
stay indoors and pray to Buddha!

12:12.500 --> 12:15.630
Stay indoors. Hurry back to our homes!

12:18.930 --> 12:20.890
Hold up, Mata no Ji.

12:20.970 --> 12:24.560
Setting up "rain" is a bit much, don't you think?

12:24.680 --> 12:27.430
What? Can't you feel this wind?

12:27.640 --> 12:29.480
It'll bring a nice rain soon enough

12:30.440 --> 12:34.190
And if thunder comes along with
it as well, I can ask for nothing more.

12:35.700 --> 12:37.280
I see...

12:37.280 --> 12:38.950
My bird tells me the same.

12:47.460 --> 12:48.580
The day of the curse?

12:49.080 --> 12:54.210
Indeed. It is being rumored everywhere
that there will be a catastrophe on a rainy night.

12:54.760 --> 13:00.430
Even the castle servants are leaving, one after
the other, to coop themselves up in their homes.

13:00.720 --> 13:01.800
It's a curse...

13:01.810 --> 13:02.930
Today is the day of the curse...

13:03.350 --> 13:05.930
The day of the curse that the monk spoke of!

13:07.020 --> 13:10.520
And this is all due to the words of a single monk?

13:12.190 --> 13:15.990
Is this not fitting weather for a calamity to occur, Juurai?

13:17.410 --> 13:19.120
The Hikasou is ready, yes?

13:19.160 --> 13:20.490
Yes, it will be shortly.

13:20.990 --> 13:21.740
Tonight.

13:22.330 --> 13:24.040
We will fire a test shot tonight.

13:24.040 --> 13:28.920
If I may speak, my Lord, I have heard that
the Hikasou can reach even the Milky Way.

13:28.920 --> 13:31.090
I suggest conducting the test
fire in less visible circumstances.

13:31.340 --> 13:32.050
Kaburagi,

13:32.840 --> 13:35.300
you seem to be under the wrong impression.

13:37.970 --> 13:39.260
Th-Then...

13:39.890 --> 13:41.520
My Lord, it's here...

13:41.730 --> 13:44.190
the "thing" from the west that
you've been wanting for a long time.

13:44.980 --> 13:46.860
The thing from the west... from the west.

13:48.860 --> 13:49.820
What is it?

14:01.120 --> 14:03.040
Momosuke-dono, this can't be...

14:04.750 --> 14:05.750
Reenacting the scroll!

14:07.050 --> 14:09.260
Stop!!

14:11.510 --> 14:14.390
Now, my Lord, please enjoy this spectacle.

14:14.970 --> 14:17.890
It's not something you see everyday, after all.

14:19.350 --> 14:20.390
I have changed my mind.

14:21.730 --> 14:22.900
Did you not hear me?

14:22.900 --> 14:24.480
You'll be the ones who are eaten.

14:24.820 --> 14:25.610
M-My Lord...

14:25.610 --> 14:27.150
Surely you jest...?

14:27.740 --> 14:29.650
You'll be the ones who are eaten.

14:30.490 --> 14:32.070
My Lord!

14:36.910 --> 14:37.910
My Lord!

14:37.960 --> 14:40.000
Wh-What is the matter?

14:56.600 --> 14:59.150
You two would have never understood.

14:59.810 --> 15:00.730
Now, the girl.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.270
No!

15:03.360 --> 15:04.360
Stop it!

15:05.700 --> 15:06.780
It begins.

15:15.460 --> 15:15.960
What?

15:21.300 --> 15:23.760
I am Lady Misaki.

15:24.260 --> 15:26.760
I am unable to carry out the vengeance I seek.

15:35.520 --> 15:37.980
Danjou-sama, it's dangerous to stay here.

15:37.980 --> 15:38.730
Come this way!

15:48.740 --> 15:49.660
Sis'?

15:53.540 --> 15:54.710
You're...!

15:54.750 --> 15:58.210
Little Miss, stop this game right here.

15:58.380 --> 16:02.430
When it comes to controlling beasts,
I've been in the business far longer than you.

16:18.320 --> 16:18.940
White Hag!

16:19.030 --> 16:19.570
Black Hag!

16:22.410 --> 16:23.370
Follow them!

16:26.290 --> 16:27.370
Mataichi-san!

16:27.910 --> 16:29.750
Momosuke-dono, quickly!

16:30.830 --> 16:32.290
Mataichi-san!!!

16:35.460 --> 16:40.340
Shiragiku, our wish will come true at last.

16:40.590 --> 16:42.470
To engulf everything in a sea of fire...

16:42.640 --> 16:45.520
No, to engulf everything in a time of utter darkness...

17:06.500 --> 17:08.580
This will all become fire...

17:08.790 --> 17:10.710
I'm afraid that's not going to happen.

17:12.760 --> 17:13.630
Mataichi!

17:14.840 --> 17:16.130
You're too late!

17:16.130 --> 17:18.180
It doesn't matter what you do.

17:20.970 --> 17:22.930
Is that so? I wonder.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.630
Waves!

17:48.170 --> 17:49.000
D-Darling!

17:50.170 --> 17:52.130
It's a tsunami!

17:56.300 --> 17:58.890
Although it did not fall upon
the city, the end result is the same.

17:59.060 --> 18:00.060
Mata no Ji,

18:00.100 --> 18:01.640
you couldn't stop it.

18:02.350 --> 18:04.480
Indeed. It was difficult.

18:05.150 --> 18:09.230
After all, the person we're after isn't a human being.

18:10.400 --> 18:13.110
If he were a human, he would
feel the pain of the human heart,

18:13.660 --> 18:16.200
but he's not a person at all.

18:16.620 --> 18:19.660
Is that not right, Kyougokutei?

18:21.000 --> 18:23.420
You have guessed well, Mataichi.

18:23.670 --> 18:26.050
I would expect no less from you, my star pupil.

18:30.220 --> 18:32.340
The darkness of the human heart will not change,

18:32.350 --> 18:35.850
no matter how you may try to purify them one by one.

18:36.270 --> 18:40.560
Deeper and deeper the
darkness goes, with no end in sight.

18:40.600 --> 18:43.360
So you're going to turn everything to darkness?

18:46.150 --> 18:48.110
I am merely returning things to their original state.

18:48.410 --> 18:50.910
After all, the present itself is an ayakashi.

18:53.580 --> 18:56.290
It is in the darkness where truth lies.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.290
You've worked well for us all this time.

18:59.880 --> 19:00.540
What?

19:00.710 --> 19:02.380
Indeed. Well done.

19:02.800 --> 19:06.550
Come! You must return to the darkness as well!

19:18.230 --> 19:19.480
Mataichi-san!

19:19.570 --> 19:20.610
Ogin-san!

19:28.280 --> 19:32.200
Kyougokutei, the one who shall
return to the darkness is you!

19:55.610 --> 19:55.940
What?

19:56.360 --> 19:57.060
What happened?

19:57.730 --> 20:01.030
The one who underestimated the
darkness the human heart is you!

20:01.950 --> 20:04.660
The darkness that lies within the
human heart is much darker than you believe.

20:08.370 --> 20:16.460
These flames are the darkness of those whom you have
killed, of those whom you have used; they're its curse...

20:16.460 --> 20:17.800
and its hatred...

20:19.050 --> 20:20.970
Take them onto yourself!

20:33.110 --> 20:34.520
Danjou-sama!

21:03.770 --> 21:04.770
It's a curse!

21:04.770 --> 21:06.230
Momosuke-dono!

21:06.730 --> 21:09.400
Everything... is turning!

21:17.950 --> 21:18.820
Mataichi-san!

21:19.660 --> 21:22.700
Sensei, this is good bye.

21:23.000 --> 21:25.000
Although I've preached at you,

21:25.250 --> 21:28.670
perhaps the real Shinigami is us.

21:29.420 --> 21:32.380
Everyone who gets involved with us dies, after all.

21:33.800 --> 21:35.880
Mataichi-san...

21:36.470 --> 21:38.890
You can still go back, sensei.

21:40.140 --> 21:41.350
Go back...

21:42.270 --> 21:44.730
to the place where you <i>live</i>.

21:47.900 --> 21:49.070
But that's...

21:53.410 --> 21:54.570
Momosuke-san!

21:59.200 --> 22:04.330
Ogin-san!

22:15.300 --> 22:21.390
Wind chimes whisper
soft and sweet

22:22.740 --> 22:28.830
Though there's not
a hint of a breeze

22:29.810 --> 22:35.580
Moonlight dancing
on the garden walk

22:34.830 --> 22:37.330
If I... turn here...

22:35.620 --> 22:42.250
As it gently drifts
through the trees

22:38.210 --> 22:39.620
Kyougokutei will be right there...

22:43.620 --> 22:49.560
Romance takes flight
on this perfect night

22:46.260 --> 22:50.680
At last, I published the book of 100 stories.

22:49.600 --> 22:56.960
While all of the world
lays sleeping

22:51.260 --> 22:54.470
I thank you for all the help you've given us.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.890
Thanks to you, I am with my wife.

22:56.270 --> 22:59.940
I spent days writing of strange things,

22:57.100 --> 23:06.570
Find us here as we feel
the moment of love

23:07.320 --> 23:08.320
but...

23:07.880 --> 23:11.080
Draw near

23:09.070 --> 23:14.480
I could write of nothing but the days
I spent with Mataichi-san and his group.

23:11.350 --> 23:16.750
Dream, sleep,
with your hand in mine

23:17.620 --> 23:21.270
I have not seen them since.

23:18.390 --> 23:23.430
Underneath a blanket of stars

23:26.500 --> 23:31.170
Song birds singing
in a distant glade

23:29.070 --> 23:41.510
Evil and ambition scatter into the darkness.
All that remains is a dubious rumor among the townsfolk.

23:35.410 --> 23:35.440
As we share
the warmth of the dawn
